"Porti-loth is a very short, overbearing Artonan healer wizard with tiny-lensed glasses."
"He is traditional to a tedious degree, and grumbled that Matadero had no healing grove."
"He healed Zeridee for hours with blood painting and song, buried in a makeshift grove."
"He claimed Alden as his patient, will heal his hand, and says human Healers would kill him."
"He told Alden to eat only the natural foods of his own world while healing."
"His healing makes a body forget its wounds, so a spell of old wounds cannot reopen them."
"He gave Alden a thermos made in Tennessee, like Alden himself."
"He refuses Alden potions, though he once made him drink a mud potion."
"Lind-otta talked him into working on the oasis ship Sdyelis Branch for the campaign."
"He and Esh-erdi bought Alden's honey locust birth tree with its Tennessee dirt."
